  "entry_scopes": {
    "closed": "Consume the complete R732 upper Gram, curvature and support report, original 32 normal stages, six physical jet streams and full actual fixed target for its immutable point. Reapply the R650 eight-role comparison and the independent R723 common-beta marked and unmarked directional conditions over all returned leaves, including the curvature requirement, both p4 caps and actual support. Retain R718 grip bounds and the separate strict unmarked tube test for R716. The R732 end and cap theorem covers the reference. Every corrected-field reach, embedding, phase and diameter assertion uses its own actual evidence.",
    "flux": "Integrate every original R716 interval flux channel on both reflected halves and the two flat caps using all complete same-point R732 normal/physical-jet records. Retain all 922 radial cells, whole circle, 32 stages, all profile/normal/terminal cuts, original accumulation journals, 600 seconds and maximum-angle-blocks 0. Reference arclength and pointwise control constraints do not settle the flux or body interpretation.",
    "moment": "Re-read all twelve recorded interval integrals and the final same-point R723 closed report. Preserve original proof and source-copy guards for p4, both caps, general centred rigid-motion tensors at 0, 1/2 and 1, signed half-turn checks and the strict independent unmarked tube condition. Conditional and incomplete evidence retains its measured scope.",
    "mesh": "Reconstruct the complete original R732 driver constructor and original all-variable closure lift. Follow the final checkpoint or specified immutable packet, match any supplied complete closed report to its original snapshot, and retain every original length, 32-stage normal, calibration and full field input. Evaluate all six jets and original spatial/phase/time refinements, including working-word comparisons, both material halves, caps, full output bytes and optional independent geometric claims.",
    "mesh_read": "Re-read the original scientific report and full command, same selected immutably saved reference and normal snapshot, complete working model and all output NPY/PLY bytes. Rebind the actual closed proof when supplied and retain each unpaid or failed claim. This reader makes no working field, chart, root or mesh evaluation."
